  "description": "*\"If you get into the same university as me, I'll grant you one wish.\"*\n\nDetermined to keep the promise made by his first love, Yongbeom—a boy who only knows how to fight—decides to study for the first time in his life. The problem? He's never seriously studied a day before. To make the impossible possible, he sets out to find the best private tutors—each one a top scorer in their subject. With an elite team of Grade 1 tutors by his side, the school's undisputed fighting champion, Yongbeom, begins a chaotic and hilarious journey toward college entrance exams.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
